@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP core / cross-cutting. Core presentation/application/files or shared authority/recovery invariant remains applicable.
skinparam backgroundColor #0D1525
skinparam defaultFontColor #EDF4FF
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #91AED1
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #1A2940
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #91AED1
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #4A302B
skinparam noteBorderColor #F1AD8A
skinparam nodesep 38
skinparam ranksep 42
title SQ — scoped authority across entry paths
top to bottom direction
rectangle "Actor context\nOwner / collaborator / viewer / operator" as Actor
rectangle "Exact resource + action + current state\nApplicable scoped authority" as Gate
rectangle "Only permitted intended effect / content\nActual result truthfully observed" as Result
Actor --> Gate : UI / direct file / provider / Git / run request
Gate --> Result : eligible intended scope only
note bottom of Gate
Sign-in / board membership / admin label is not universal power.
Employer viewer requires no product account but only selected access.
Current grant changes and in-flight policy remain explicit.
end note

legend bottom
Logical analysis / evidence boundaries, not installed controls or selected architecture.
No security, load, provider, backup, restore or live-change operation performed.
endlegend
@enduml
